        <title><![CDATA[Beatings, cyberattacks and threats darken Vucic’s Serbia ahead of elections]]></title>
        <description><![CDATA[Serbian activist Marko Marjanovic was on his way back from the supermarket in Belgrade when masked officers bundled him into a car and took him to a police station basement where he was held in solitary confinement for two days under bright lights.]]></description>
        
        <author><![CDATA[Reuters]]></author>
