        <title><![CDATA[Two killed, 8 injured in attack on airport in Saudi oil city Dammam]]></title>
        <description><![CDATA[Two people were killed and eight were injured in an attack on Wednesday evening on King Fahd International Airport in Saudi Arabia's eastern oil city of Dammam, Saudi Arabia's General Authority of Civil Aviation said on Thursday.]]></description>
        
